    {
     "from": "p7",
     "to": "e"
    }
   ]
  },
  "steps": [
   {
    "text": "Receive request {requestId, records [{DTP_REC_ID, VERSION}]} from the DTP Creation screen; log message no. 1.",
    "children": [
     "User not VPLD Planner: log message no. 3. Stop.",
     "No record: log message no. 4. Stop.",
     "Request id already in TB_R_DTP_SWITCH_REQ: return stored result, log message no. 2. Stop.",
     "Insert TB_R_DTP_SWITCH_REQ with STATUS 'PROCESSING'."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "BEGIN TRANSACTION. Select the DTP records WITH (UPDLOCK) and, for Processed records, the linked Daily order and cycles WITH (UPDLOCK).",
    "children": [
     "Lock / connection error: log message no. 5."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Re-check every record with the rules of Functional Description 4.1 (latest data, not the screen data); VERSION must equal the version shown.",
    "children": []
   },
   {
    "text": "If any record fails: ROLLBACK, request log 'REJECTED' with the failed list (409). Nothing changed (all-or-nothing, as Submit DT-15).",
    "children": [
     "Not submitted: log message no. 6; Processing / version / order missing: log message no. 7; driver started: log message no. 8."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Per record, by previous status:",
    "children": [
     "Submitted / Queued / Failed: delete the queue entry of the record.",
     "Processed: cancel the Daily order (CANCEL_FLAG 'Y'), release the active truck assignment (ACTIVE_FLAG 'N'), insert TB_H_ORDER_ASSIGN 'DTP Switching', insert TB_T_DRIVER_SYNC_QUEUE 'ORDER_UPDATE' (driver card removed)."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Update TB_R_DTP_RECORD: STATUS 'Available', ORDER_NO / SUBMITTED_BY / SUBMITTED_DT / FAIL_REASON null, ATTEMPT_CNT 0, VERSION + 1. Re-validate the record (DTP Creation rules DT-04..DT-10); if invalid: STATUS 'Validation Error' with ERROR_MSG."
   },
   {
    "text": "Insert TB_H_DTP_RECORD_STS (status history) and TB_H_DTP_SWITCH (switch audit with order snapshot); log message no. 10."
   },
   {
    "text": "COMMIT; request log 'SUCCESS' with counts; log message no. 11. Any DB error in steps 5-7: ROLLBACK everything, request log 'ERROR', log message no. 9. Unexpected error: log message no. 12."
   }
  ]
 },
